                <pb facs="0533" n="409" xml:id="pg409"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.74/60: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Crane</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-01-26T12:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 26,
                                1921—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received January 27—2:24
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>60. My 41, January 20, 2 p.m. Ministry of Communications informs me Japanese
                    Minister has made representations to Foreign Office on the basis Mitsui
                    contract.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Crane</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
